        "created_at": "2014-01-16T17:39:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So many heros fall into many of those catagories to varrying degrees.</p><p>Legacy. He is every bit of your \"Tank\" as he is your \"Defender\" with strong chunks of \"Controller\"</p><p>I do not see any hero as being so clear cut purely from a mechanical/gameplay perspective.</p><p>Thematically however I think there is nothing wrong with how you see it. Very reminicent of City of Heros/DC Online catagories for hero creation.</p>",
