        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/danmarshall14/{size}/1944_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-16T18:18:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As Foote pointed out,&nbsp;each hero has&nbsp;the capacity to fall across many categories, if not all, to some degree.&nbsp; What's extra fun about the promo cards is that you can see just how much their role is allowed to shift simply by changing their base power and HP.&nbsp; Young Legacy for example gives up an incredibly strong support buff and some base HP for the strongest base power in the game.&nbsp; This can completely change how Legacy plays, going from a buffing support to a primary damage dealer.</p>",
