        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-16T19:04:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"SuperRick\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/superrick/48/2705_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> SuperRick:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span>It's obvious they don't fit 100%, but if anyone wanted to categorize them \"where they leaned,\" that would be great for helping me better grasp the game (and explain it to others).&nbsp;</span><strong>Maybe just three categories:</strong><span>Strong Tank (excells at absorbing damage)Strong Damage Dealer (excells at dealing damage)Strong Support (excells at crowd control, buffs and debuffs)</span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Have you checked out this thread?</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/an-attempt-to-make-hero-ratings-or-a-great-excuse-to-argue-4556\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/an-attempt-to-make-hero-ratings-or-a-great-excuse-to-argue-4556</a></p>\n<p>If that doesnt scratch your itch, Im not sure what will&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=12\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>The \"Mechanics\" catagory might be a tad bit esoteric, certainly but the 3 main catagories of Offense/Defense/Support fit your bill and are further broken down into 4 sub catagories of each. You should be able to draw decent conclusions for Skippys rubric.</p>",
