      {
        "id": 86952,
        "name": "XXVZ",
        "username": "XXVZ",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/xxvz/{size}/2367_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-17T03:03:33.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>This is kinda how I catogorize,</p><p>Brawler: High multi-target damage</p><p>Support: buffs, debuffs or card control</p><p>Tank: high health or armor</p><p>Assassin: high single target damage</p><p>Legacy: Tank/Support</p><p>Wraith: EVERYTHING</p><p>Bunker: Tank/Assassin</p><p>Tachyon: Assassin/Support</p><p>Absolute Zero: Tank/Assassin</p><p>Haka: Tank</p><p>Tempest: Brawler</p><p>Ra: Assassin</p><p>Fanatic: Assassin</p><p>Visionary: Support</p><p>Mr. Fixer: Assassin/Support*</p><p>Expatriot: Assassin*</p><p>Nightmist: Support/Assassin*</p><p>Argent Adept: Support*</p><p>Chrono-Ranger: Assassin/Brawler</p><p>Omnitron X: Support/Assassin</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*I have not played these heroes but have got their classification from forum talk</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, these are not nearly perfect and some heroes (Tachyon, Bunker, Tempest) could go into multiple.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:11:05.398Z",
