      {
        "id": 86953,
        "name": "mlangsdorf",
        "username": "mlangsdorf",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c4cdca/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-08T19:32:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You should look at this thread at Board Games Geek:</p><p>http://boardgamegeek.com/thread/1112128/detailed-heroboss-selection-guide</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I go through most of the heroes, villains, and environments and give a short blurb on what kind and how much damage they do and their abilities for on-going or environment destruction, deck search and manipulation, healing, support, and stuff like that. It's intended to be a quick intro to the game.</p><p>I don't think your 5 categories really map well to how SotM plays, so I think it's better just to know what kinds of damage or other things people do and what kinds of targets and issues the various villains and environments are going to put out.</p>",
